  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "今日は、帰ったら一緒に鍋しよ～って\r\n寮のみんなと約束しとるとよ～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "鍋か……いいな、あったまりそうで\r\nこたつで鍋は、冬ならではの楽しみだしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00310",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ\r\nそう言えば、こたつは新調したのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～\r\nこたつのこと、覚えとってくれたと？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "色々考えて\r\n修理して使うことにしたばい！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、そうなのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00264",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "天板拭きながら、こん傷ついた時、\r\nみんなで大騒ぎしたっけ～……とか……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちがちょっと左に座ると、\r\nみんなよか塩梅でテレビ見られる～……とか……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "色々思い出しとったら、\r\nお別れしづらくなってしまったと！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほどな……\r\n寂しくなるの、わかる気がするよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～～～、そうやろ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そん代わり、でもなかけど\r\n湯たんぽば買ったばい！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "猫の形のふわふわで温っか～で、\r\n可愛かやつ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……\r\n冬を迎える準備は万全だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん～！\r\n冬、いつでも来んね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘がどの季節も目一杯楽しんでるのを見ると、\r\n何だか俺まで楽しくなってくるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "冬は魚のうまか季節やし……\r\n鍋も、こたつみかんもあるし～……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "クリスマスとかお正月の\r\n行事もいっぱいあるばい～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ふふっ、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "冬も、その先の春も……\r\nうちは全部、楽しみやけん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちと一緒に、\r\nアンティーカのみんなもおって",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004012110170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "その……、プロデューサーも──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401211/2004012110170"
  },
  {
